  <section xml:id="sec-scale-exercise-7ths-chromatic">
    <title>7th Chords — With Chromatic Pickups</title>
    <p>
      </p>

    <figure xml:id="fig-scale-exercise-7ths-chromatic">
      <caption>
        Diatonic 7th chord arpeggios with chromatic pickups</caption>
      <image xml:id="img-scale-exercise-7ths-chromatic"
